<div class="help-layout__content contact-layout__content">
<h1 class="contact-layout__title">Contact collections team</h1>
<p class="contact-layout__lead">Contact the team that cares for each collection directly. Choose the collection you're interested in below to find its contact method: an email address or an external Access Request Form.</p>

<section aria-labelledby="h-collections">
<h2 id="h-collections">Contact a collection</h2>
<p>Email the team that cares for the collection, or open its external Access Request Form. We aim to respond within 5 business days.</p>
<h3 id="h-mdhs">Medical and dental museums (MDHS Vernon collections)</h3>
<ul aria-labelledby="h-mdhs">
<li><strong>Harry Brookes Allen Museum of Anatomy and Pathology:</strong> <a href="mailto:MDHS-museum@unimelb.edu.au">MDHS-museum@unimelb.edu.au</a></li>
<li><strong>Henry Forman Atkinson Dental Museum:</strong> <a href="mailto:MDHS-museum@unimelb.edu.au">MDHS-museum@unimelb.edu.au</a></li>
<li><strong>Medical History Museum:</strong> <a href="mailto:MDHS-museum@unimelb.edu.au">MDHS-museum@unimelb.edu.au</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="h-mc">Museums &amp; Collections (M&amp;C)</h3>
<ul aria-labelledby="h-mc">
<li><strong>Grainger Museum Collection:</strong> <a href="https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/ccs-access-request" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Access Request Form<span class="sr-only"> for Grainger Museum Collection (external, opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>
<li><strong>University Art Collection:</strong> <a href="https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/ccs-access-request" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Access Request Form<span class="sr-only"> for University Art Collection (external, opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>
</ul>
</section>

