<section aria-labelledby="h-steps">
<h2 id="h-steps">Before you get in touch</h2>
<ol>
<li>Find the record you are asking about.</li>
<li>Copy its persistent link or UoM ID from the record page.</li>
<li>Email the collection, or open its form, and describe what you need.</li>
</ol>
<p><a href="<%= help_path(topic: "access") %>">Access and information</a></p>
</section>

